  "notes": [
    "messages are the Sig_structure of a real manifest built by pq_cose.py",
    "chain: decode COSE, parse three X.509 certificates, verify the leaf's and the intermediate's signatures (the anchor is trusted, not re-verified)",
    "manifest_full / _chain / _leaf / _thumb: copy the manifest into a receive buffer, then decode it, resolve the chain (from the manifest, or from the trust store for the parts not carried), verify chain and manifest signature",
    "buffers_bytes: receive buffer + rebuilt Sig_structure, both live at once; stack_bytes: peak stack of one call, by stack painting",
    "Ed25519: Monocypher 4; ES256: micro-ecc P-256 with PQClean SHA-256",
    "ML-DSA: pqm4 m4f; hw=1 rows: ES256, Ed25519 and SHA-256 on the CryptoCell-310 through PSA (CC3XX driver only), key import inside each timed call; DWT cycles at 64 MHz"
